WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.669
-The president is now telling
government officials

00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:05.438
to ignore the law
when it comes to immigration.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.540
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.108
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:12.011 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.780
Trump is once again freaking out
about the border.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.751
Last week he went to California
to tour a section

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:20.854
of the border wall he claims
his administration has built.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.822
But in reality,
plans for that wall

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.590
date back to
the Obama administration.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.058
All Trump did was renovate it.

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:27.927
And he's mad that people
keep pointing that out.

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.995
So today he tried a new argument
to convince people

00:00:29.995 --> 00:00:33.900
that he is definitely building
his own, brand-new border wall.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.502
-We've built a lot of wall.
A lot of wall.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.071
And it's new wall.
You know, when we rip down

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:42.609
an old wall and then replace it,
it's called a new wall.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:46.846
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, is that what it's called?

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:49.048
Thanks a lot, Bob Vila.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.382
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:51.550
Trump isn't the president.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.319
He's like a wannabe
Property Brother.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.823
He's a Property Stepbrother.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:59.525
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.293
Trump, of course,
bypassed Congress and declared

00:01:01.293 --> 00:01:03.095
a national emergency
to build this wall,

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:04.964
and he did so after
the Republican Party

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:07.733
and right-wing pundits spent
years lecturing the rest of us

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.803
about the sanctity
of the Constitution.

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:12.604
In fact, Trump himself made
a big show during the campaign

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:15.941
of saying how much he personally
loved the Constitution.

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.812
-I feel very strongly
about our Constitution.

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.179
I'm proud of it. I love it.

00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:22.148
And I want to go through
the Constitution.

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.483
That's what we want to do.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:26.319
I mean, we want to bring
the Constitution back.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:27.853
-What do you mean,
bring it back?

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:29.888
It didn't go anywhere.

00:01:29.888 --> 00:01:32.925
Someone must have switched
his Fox News to HBO

00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:36.062
and now he thinks Nick Cage
actually stole the Constitution.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.263
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.898
[ As Trump ]
I saw it on the news.

00:01:39.898 --> 00:01:41.467
I saw it on the news.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.302
It was on the news
and let me tell you,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:44.671
he's not going to be easy
to find

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:46.406
because he has
John Travolta's face.

00:01:46.406 --> 00:01:48.374
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.075
[ Normal voice ]
Trump, Republicans, and Fox News

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:52.478
spent years telling their
audience that President Obama

00:01:52.478 --> 00:01:54.480
was a dictator
trampling on the Constitution,

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.150
and yet all of those same people
are now vocally supporting

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.818
a president who's been going
around and saying

00:01:58.818 --> 00:02:01.053
he wants to get rid of judges
in courts

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:04.256
and complaining that migrants
who exercise their legal right

00:02:04.256 --> 00:02:06.258
to seek asylum
get to talk to a lawyer.

00:02:06.258 --> 00:02:08.594
-We have to do something
about asylum,

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:11.264
and to be honest with you,
we have to get rid of judges.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:13.799
They have to get rid of
the whole asylum system

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:15.168
because it doesn't work.

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:18.104
Frankly,
we should get rid of judges.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:20.006
We have a stupid system
of courts.

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.407
It's the craziest thing
in the world.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.811
Our laws are so corrupt
and so stupid.

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.913
I call them the dumbest
immigration laws

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.081
anywhere on Earth.

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:30.883
If a person puts their foot
over the line,

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:33.819
we have to take them
into our country.

00:02:33.819 --> 00:02:36.189
We have to register them.

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:39.525
We then have to ask them
a couple of questions.

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:42.161
Lawyers are telling them
what to say.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.029
They read a little page

00:02:44.029 --> 00:02:46.199
given by lawyers
that are all over the place.

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:49.269
You know lawyers.
They tell them what to say.

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:51.604
-Of course it makes sense
that Trump hates lawyers

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.473
since this guy is his lawyer.

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:54.406
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.406 --> 00:02:55.341
I mean, look at him.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.210
It's not good.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:01.246
It's not good when your lawyer
always looks surprised.

00:03:01.246 --> 00:03:04.450
I mean, Rudy constantly looks
like he just found out

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.018
