00:03:06.018 --> 00:03:07.253
[ As Giuliani ]That guy?!

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.422
Oh, but he's so guilty.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:11.024
Oh, no, Rudy.

00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:13.226
Oh, you stepped in it this time.

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:14.560
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:17.463
Trump wants to get rid of judges
and lawyers and courts.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.232
He doesn't care
